            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.20.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 20:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga cakuti bamunyina bekala pamo, elyo umo afwa ukwabula ukufyalapo umwana umwaume, mukamfwilwa talingile kupwa ku muntu umbi uushili wa mu lupwa lwakwa wiba. Munyina wa mulume ali nokumusenda ukuba umukashi wakwe, alebomba ne milimo munyina alebomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwana wantanshi umwaume uo umwanakashi akafyala, ali nokulaitwa ishina lya uyo uwafwa, munyina kwa wishi, pakuti ishina lyakwe likaloba mu Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.4.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ruti 4:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba, nga cakuti munyina akaana ukupa uyo mwanakashi, ali nokuya ku bakalamba pa mpongolo ya musumba no kuya beba ati, ‘Munyina kwa mulume wandi nakaana ukubuula ishina lyakwa munyina mu Israeli. Taalemombela ifyo munyina alemombela.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakalamba ba musumba bakete uyu munyina no kulanshanya nankwe. Nga cakuti atwalilila ukusosa ukuti, ‘Nshilefwaya ukumuupa,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukamfwilwa akamupalamina pa cinso ca bakalamba, akamufule ulusapato lumo, elyo akamufwishile amate ku menso no kusosa ati, ‘Ifi efyo bacita umwaume uwakaana ukulundulula ulupwa lwakwa munyina.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu calo ca Israeli ishina lya ulo lupwa lwa mwaume bakalalwita abati, ‘Ulupwa Lwakwa Mufulwa Lusapato.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
